#: ../../index.rst:3
msgid "1 Getting Started"
msgstr "1 Kom godt i gang"

#: ../../index.rst:6
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Introduktion"

#: ../../index.rst:8
msgid ""
"Welcome to the |prodname| Mac OS X Client User Guide. This guide "
"describes client functionality for users in |prodname|, the managed file "
"synchronization and sharing solution that focuses on file server cloud-"
"enablement."
msgstr "Velkommen til |prodname| Mac OS X Client brugervejledning. Denne vejledning beskriver klientfunktionalitet for brugere i |prodname|, den administrerede filsynkronisering og delingsløsning, der fokuserer på cloud-aktivering af filservere."

#: ../../index.rst:12
msgid "Mac OS X Clients"
msgstr "Mac OS X-klienter"

#: ../../index.rst:14
msgid ""
"|prodname| client agents are available for Windows, Mac, iOS, Android, "
"and Windows phones. These clients are designed to work with your "
"|prodname| account that your Managed Service Provider has set up for you "
"or your company IT has setup for you."
msgstr "|prodname| klientagenter er tilgængelige for Windows, Mac, iOS, Android og Windows-telefoner. Disse klienter er designet til at arbejde med din |prodname| konto, som din Managed Service Provider har opsat for dig, eller dit firmas IT har opsat for dig."

#: ../../index.rst:18
msgid "System Requirement"
msgstr "Systemkrav"

#: ../../index.rst:20
msgid "Mac OS X 10.14/10.13/10.12"
msgstr "Mac OS X 10.14/10.13/10.12"

#: ../../index.rst:22
msgid ""
"Mac OS X client for these OS versions are actively maintained and relesed"
" regularlly."
msgstr "Mac OS X-klienter til disse OS-versioner vedligeholdes aktivt og udgives regelmæssigt."

#: ../../index.rst:24
msgid "Mac OS X 10.7/10.8/10.9/10.10/10.11"
msgstr "Mac OS X 10.7/10.8/10.9/10.10/10.11"

#: ../../index.rst:26
msgid ""
"Mac OS X client for these OS versions are available but not actively "
"maintained."
msgstr "Mac OS X-klient til disse OS-versioner er tilgængelig, men vedligeholdes ikke aktivt."

#: ../../index.rst:32
msgid "This guide is updated to match Mac Client version 9.7.41664"
msgstr "Denne vejledning er opdateret til at passe til Mac-klient version 9.7.41664"

